@startuml
[*] --> InitialState
InitialState -> VersionList : Display Version List
VersionList -> CreateVersion : Create New Version
CreateVersion -> VersionCreated : Version Created
VersionCreated -> VersionSaved : Save Version
VersionCreated -> VersionList : Discard Version
VersionList -> LoadVersion : Load Version
LoadVersion -> VersionLoaded : Version Loaded
VersionLoaded -> VersionReverted : Revert Version
VersionLoaded -> VersionSaved : Save Changes
VersionSaved -> VersionList : Return to Version List
VersionReverted -> VersionList : Return to Version List
VersionList --> [*]
@enduml
